### 1. Create a group (saves the id for the next requests)
POST http://localhost:8080/groups
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Lisbon trip", "description": "Flights, food, fun"}

> {% client.global.set("gid", response.body.id); %}

### 2. Add members
POST http://localhost:8080/groups/{{gid}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{"uid": "ana", "name": "Ana", "email": "ana@example.com"}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/groups/{{gid}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{"uid": "bob", "name": "Bob", "email": "bob@example.com"}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/groups/{{gid}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{"uid": "cris", "name": "Cris", "email": "cris@example.com"}

### 3. Ana pays 100.00 for dinner
POST http://localhost:8080/groups/{{gid}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: dinner-1

{"memberId": "ana", "amount": 100.00}

### 4. Balances: ana 66.66, bob -33.33, cris -33.33
GET http://localhost:8080/groups/{{gid}}/balances

### 5. Retry the same request: still 201, balances unchanged (run 4 again)
POST http://localhost:8080/groups/{{gid}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: dinner-1

{"memberId": "ana", "amount": 100.00}

### 6. Same key, different amount: 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/groups/{{gid}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: dinner-1

{"memberId": "ana", "amount": 999.00}

### 7. Bob pays Ana 33.33, then run 4 again: bob is 0
POST http://localhost:8080/groups/{{gid}}/settlements
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: settle-1

{"payerId": "bob", "receiverId": "ana", "amount": 33.33}

### 8. Unknown group: 404
GET http://localhost:8080/groups/does-not-exist/balances
